  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.2 — Catalog bump to whfmt.FileFormatCatalog 1.3.2 (Phase B audit + bug fixes, 799 definitions, schema v3 canonical). No CodeGen API changes. 1.1.1 — VB.NET output language (--lang vb): Public Class with BinaryReader, typed enums for valueMap, <Flags> enum for bitfields, List(Of T) for repeating fields, nullable for conditionals, big-endian ReverseBytes helpers. 1.1.0 — dump command, rich types, typed exceptions, C#-Span / F# / Rust output, --project flag.",
